ues inconsistent with binary path or icon). Launch is correlated with user logon or persistence setup.","platforms":["macOS"],"strategy_id":"DET0127"},{"id":"AN0358","name":"Analytic 0358","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0127#AN0358","guidance":"Adversary uses renamed container images, injects files into containers with misleading names or metadata (e.g., renamed system binaries), and executes them during startup or scheduled jobs.","platforms":["Containers"],"strategy_id":"DET0127"},{"id":"AN0359","name":"Analytic 0359","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0127#AN0359","guidance":"Adversary places scripts or binaries with misleading names in /etc/rc.local.d or /var/spool/cron, or registers services with legitimate-sounding names not present in default ESXi builds.","platforms":["ESXi"],"strategy_id":"DET0127"}],"log_sources":[{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"WinEventLog:Sysmon","channel":"EventCode=1","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0355","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0127#AN0355","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0060","component":"Service Creation","name":"WinEventLog:System","channel":"EventCode=7045","platforms":["Windows"],"analytic_id":"AN0355","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0127#AN0355","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0060/"},{"component_id":"DC0032","component":"Process Creation","name":"auditd:SYSCALL","channel":"execve","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0356","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0127#AN0356","validation":"upstream_definition_not_locally_validated","component_page":"telemetry/DC0032/"},{"component_id":"DC0061","component":"File Modification","name":"linux:syslog","channel":"rename","platforms":["Linux"],"analytic_id":"AN0356","source_ur